  "statement_html": "<div class=\"wims_columns\">\t  <div class=\"medium_size text_col\">\t Le jeu consiste à s'engager dans un dédale et à le parcourir avec la règle suivante :\t on ne peut aller que vers le nord ou vers l'est, et à chaque carrefour, on choisit\t la direction en lançant une pièce : pile on va vers le Nord, face on va vers l'Est.\t A chacune des 6 sorties possibles est associé un résultat : on peut gagner 100 euros,\t 200 euros ou perdre 300 euros.\t </div>\t <div class=\"medium_size img_col\"><span class=\"pax-fig-group\"> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" viewBox=\"0 0 225 225\"><polygon points=\"11.84,150.00 47.37,150.00 47.37,135.00 23.68,135.00 23.68,105.00 47.37,105.00 47.37,90.00 23.68,90.00 23.68,60.00 47.37,60.00 47.37,45.00 11.84,45.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"11.84,210.00 189.47,210.00 189.47,180.00 165.79,180.00 165.79,195.00 142.11,195.00 142.11,180.00 118.42,180.00 118.42,195.00 94.74,195.00 94.74,180.00 71.05,180.00 71.05,195.00 47.37,195.00 47.37,180.00 11.84,180.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"71.05,150.00 94.74,150.00 94.74,135.00 71.05,135.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"71.05,105.00 94.74,105.00 94.74,90.00 71.05,90.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"71.05,60.00 94.74,60.00 94.74,45.00 71.05,45.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"118.42,150.00 142.11,150.00 142.11,135.00 118.42,135.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"118.42,105.00 142.11,105.00 142.11,90.00 118.42,90.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"118.42,60.00 142.11,60.00 142.11,45.00 118.42,45.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"165.79,150.00 189.47,150.00 189.47,135.00 165.79,135.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"165.79,105.00 189.47,105.00 189.47,90.00 165.79,90.00\" fill=\"#000000\" stroke=\"none\" /><polygon points=\"16